  "note": "Hand-authored CONVEX extents — the SOURCE for scripts/build-atlas-polities.js, which clips them to real coastlines and inland waters to produce atlas-polities.json. Edit this file, never the generated one. Extents must stay convex: the clip is exact only for a convex clip region, and both the build and atlas-polities.test.js fail loudly if one is not.",
